data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"file_path\": \"/tmp/m1_reply.md\", \"content\": \"# Mission m1 — concluded\\n\\nDispatched the mission requirements to `dev` (d002). Dev delivered\\n`src/greet.py` with `greet(name)` returning `\\\"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\\\"` and\\n`tests/test_greet.py` with tests for a normal name and the empty string,\\ncommitted as `8d832fa` on `cs-sandbox/<DEV:1>.<GROUP:1>`.\\n\\nVerified independently by fetching the branch, diffing it against base\\n(only the two expected files added), extracting the tree into a scratch\\ndirectory, and running `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` myself —\\nresult: `OK`, exit 0. Accepted d002.\\n\\nAll three stated criteria (greet.py, test_greet.py with both cases,\\ntests passing) are satisfied. Full report at\\n~/.local/share/cs-campaign/output/report.md.\\n\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":0,"type":"content_block_delta"}

